						<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
							Carts for OTOW folks. Just take <strong>SR-200</strong> to find us.
						</p>
						<a href="/golf-carts-for-sale-otow" class="text-brand-green font-bold hover:underline">Learn More</a>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200 text-center">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">The Villages</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
